WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay?!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:36.530
I'm Kurata Sana, first year
junior high school student!

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:39.030
The amazing white bat, Babbit!

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:43.700
My friend, Hayama Akito.

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.290
My best friend, Fuka.

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:50.380
Hayama's elder sister, Natsumi-nee-chan! Also today's leading role!

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:55.380
When My Elder Sister
is in Love

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:02.850
Hmm... I'll turn off the alarm clock...

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:05.770
Go ahead and oversleep.

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:07.190
At 5 A.M.

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:10.770
She over slept a little...

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:20.200
Natsumi who got up early

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:18.110
Why did you get up so early?

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:19.950
Babbit Punch!

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:26.200
Thanks for the meal.

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:28.790
- Oh, Natsumi.
- Yes?

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:31.250
You ate pretty fast.
Do you have something to do?

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:35.210
Uh... I promised to meet a friend...

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:36.460
Male one?

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:40.550
Gosh, Akito! You don't need to be
so suspicious!

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:41.550
Is it a boy?

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:43.260
- Mm, yeah.
- See?

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:44.180
I see...

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:48.350
Just leave the dishes when you're
done, I'll clean them up later.

00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:51.900
Natsumi... as your father,
I'm a little worried...

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:54.610
In a peaceful morning on Sunday

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:54.610
Is this the soap sitcom?

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:58.070
The Barbe Show of Tomo-chan and Sana!

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:00.070
Sana-chan...!

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:02.780
Well, see you later!

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:07.040
Mm? You are not going to watch
this? You always do...

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:09.460
No. I'm running late.

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:11.920
I even prepared the rice crackers.

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:15.420
If daddy doesn't watch the show
with Natsumi and rice crackers,

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:17.920
it doesn't feel like a Sunday morning at all...

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:20.800
Was like that before?

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:24.890
I'll go grocery shopping for
dinner on the way. I'm leaving!

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:28.850
Natsumi... is acting a little
different than usual...

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:32.560
Who in the world wants to be
Natsumi's boyfriend?

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:36.520
Natsumi's... boyfriend?

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:40.280
A Sunday with a date

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:38.530
Hold up, Dad!

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:40.240
Metropolitan.

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:41.610
Say Cheese!

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:44.120
Hey! What's this?

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:47.740
It's done.

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:49.540
- Let's split it!
- Okay.

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:51.330
I don't have any scissors,
so I'll tear it apart.

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:54.170
Sana-chan, hold on!
Okay, huddle up!

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:56.750
Yes, Tomo-chan? What? What?
Yes? What's up?

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:58.170
Cut this in half.

00:03:58.170 --> 00:03:59.550
Here you go!

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:01.300
Thanks,
you can't leave now. Split!

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:03.010
It's cut.

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:05.140
Okay, here's your portion.

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:06.390
What was that?

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:08.260
Sorry, can't tell ya.

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:09.770
Fine then.

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:12.440
I think I was hit by
something...

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:14.730
I won't tell what hit you either.

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:16.020
Hey, that's...

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:18.570
Hayama's sister.

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:22.030
There's no mistake. That person's
back clearly says 'Hayama'.

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:24.910
- And that guy next to her is...
- Listen to me...

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:26.660
Ah! They're on a date!

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:28.620
That was pretty cool, huh?

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:34.500
Really awesome! I was totally
blown away by it!

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:37.500
- Will you share a little more with
me next time? - Oh, sure.

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:41.260
- They look good together.
- Do you know those people, Sana-chan?

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:42.760
My best friend's elder sister.

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:44.340
No wonder it took away your
attention.

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:46.300
Alright! I have go tell Hayama.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:48.180
Forget it, maybe next time.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:50.390
We're supposed to go shopping.

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:51.350
Aren't we?

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:53.430
I heard they have sales at
the department store.

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:55.690
Lift your spirits! Let's go!

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:22.880
You're too noisy!

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:28.800
Let's go home

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:27.470
Time's gone when you two were staring at each other.

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:28.760
White dolphin!

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:34.100
I'm home!

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:36.560
Dad, you're at home?

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:38.810
Why don't you turn on the lights?

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:41.690
Oh, welcome home, Natsumi.

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:43.820
Are you not feeling well?

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:46.900
No, there's
nothing wrong with dad.

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:49.280
Is that so? I'm relieved.

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:52.330
Well, I'll go make dinner.
Where's Akito?

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:55.620
Ah... Probably jogging
somewhere around here.

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:57.870
He'll come back for dinner, right?

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:06.420
Hayama, I was waiting for you,
lovely boy!

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:08.010
What's up. All of a sudden?

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:10.050
I'm going undercover! Ha!

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:13.640
- So what?
- I saw it! I saw it! I saw it!

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:17.390
I saw your sister at Harajuku today!

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:19.900
She was on date with a guy!

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:21.610
The two of them!

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:25.780
I witnessed Sister Natsumi
dating at that particular location!

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:27.820
Oh, bye.

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:31.990
What the heck, Hayama.
Your reaction is so cold, as always.

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:34.660
Don't you care about your sister?

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:36.950
Her is her... Me is me...

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:38.830
What a cold guy.

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:41.830
It won't kill him to respond to me
just for once!

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:44.300
- How unsupportive.
- I agree.

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:47.470
You said Natsumi was on a date, right?

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:49.180
You're kidding me!

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:51.640
Who's the other guy?

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:54.760
Well, what kind of person is he?
I'm so concerned!

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:58.560
Stop it! Quit that!

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:00.690
How uncute!

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:02.150
Ah! Sana-chan!

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:03.860
Oh, good afternoon.

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:05.520
Long time no see, Sana-chan!

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:07.610
Is that so?

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:11.610
You haven't been to our house in
a while, I missed you so much.

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:14.490
Hey, Akito,
are you dating each other?

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:15.490
No way!

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:17.870
Oh, yeah, Sana-chan!
Wanna have dinner?

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:20.460
- Have dinner at our house!
- I'll pas...

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:22.540
Then it's decided.
Let's go, Akito.

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:27.420
With Natsumi's good mood Sana had to get adrift.

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:30.010
Having dinner at
Hayama's home

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:29.970
- That was good, I'm full.
- What? Finished already?

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:34.850
I'm sorry you have to help me clean up.

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:37.520
No problem, thanks for
the great food.

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:41.640
I saw you at Harajuku today.

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:45.110
Eh? Sana-chan was
in Harajuku also?

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:48.440
I sometimes go shopping there.

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:51.280
Why are you blushing?

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:53.610
Really...

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:58.790
His name is Nishikawa-san.

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:02.040
He's good at everything.
Including sports and school.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:05.040
Many people idolize him at our
school.

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:07.710
White dolphin!

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:11.630
I summoned up all my courage, and
gave him a Valentine chocolate.

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:13.930
And then...

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:15.930
What am I saying?!

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:18.220
Umm... Valentine, is it?

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:21.890
In Sana-chan's eyes, she gives
out chocolates to the fans on Valentine's Day.

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:23.640
Absolutely not romantic.

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:27.150
Then, Sana-chan, what do you think
about Nishikawa-san?

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:31.440
Uh... like a very good looking...

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:35.160
- Movie star, right?
- Yeah, exactly.

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:37.870
Speaking of stars, there are many
different kinds...

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:40.040
Are you happy, sister?

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:43.210
Mm? Um... about that...

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:46.750
Can't... seem... to find peace...

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:54.510
Dad is concerned about Natsumi...

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:58.300
Of course a father will be concerned about that.

00:08:54.880 --> 00:09:01.640
Natsumi's boyfriend

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:01.520
- It's only a matter of time.
- Who's next?

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:04.100
Sister Natsumi high school.

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:05.310
Here you go.

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:09.230
Thank you very much, it's
Hayama-san's homemade lunch...

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:11.110
I'm so happy.

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:14.490
My dad's lunch...

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:16.240
Sir, did you ask for me?

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:20.330
Yes, I would like you to print out
this file.

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:22.750
- I understand.
- Dad's office.

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:26.210
Wait! You happy little thing!

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:28.710
Mr. Hayama gave me work to do!

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:30.210
I'm so jealous.

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:32.050
Father Hayama seems to be
popular, huh?

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:36.010
Mr. Hayama has high working standards, he's good-looking, and attractive.

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:39.470
Not just female workers, even the
male ones look up to him!

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:41.060
She talked to me...

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:44.020
Look, he's going to eat his lunch.

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:46.100
Have some tea, boss!

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:48.560
Thanks, everyone. Excuse me.

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:56.570
This is...

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:59.320
- Mr. Hayama seems surprised.
- Did something happen?

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:02.080
- It's the first time I see him
sunned like that. - Me too.

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:03.450
That's not dad's lunch.

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:08.330
Oh, when I have free time?
I usually go shopping.

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:14.050
I see. Then, say something to your
fans as a closing.

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:17.010
Huh? Isn't that...

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:19.340
Sana-chan,
say something to your fans.

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:23.350
Beneath the sky of Paris!
By the riverside today!

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:26.560
Thanks you very much for your
hard work.

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:28.940
Yes, thank you very much,
Sana-chan.

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:29.900
I'm leaving!

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:33.190
Isn't that...

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:37.650
Yes, that one guy show was dating
Hayama's sister at Harajuku?

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:39.660
What was his name?

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:41.950
Koriyama was it?

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:46.500
But, the one next to him isn't
Hayama's sister!

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:50.670
He dated her last time, is he
dating someone else this time?

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:53.750
What's going on? Does Hayama's
sister know about this?

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:56.210
Or maybe that's
his younger sister?

00:10:56.210 --> 00:10:58.340
Or is he really a playboy?

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:01.510
Umm... should I tell Hayama's sister?

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:02.470
What should I do...?

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:03.430
Sana...

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:05.140
Ah! Fuka!

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:08.020
What were you mumbling about?

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:11.810
To tell you the truth, I think I
saw something that I wasn't supposed to.

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:13.190
Now what should I do?

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:17.280
Should I tell? Or should I not?
It's giving me a hard time.

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:20.450
You mean about Hayama's sister's
boyfriend's betrayal?

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:21.530
How did you know?

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:24.120
You said the whole thing a while ago.

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:26.080
Yeah, that's what it is...

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:28.160
Does Akito know about this?

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:30.370
I don't think... so...

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:32.830
It's probably a better idea to
keep it to yourself.

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:35.960
Because this is a very troublesome
matter.

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:39.380
Yes, this is the Hayama's.

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:41.630
Oh, Nishikawa-san?

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:44.720
Yes, are you done with your
business?

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:46.100
Eh? Tomorrow?

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:49.810
Is that alright?
I'll bring that CD over.

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:54.100
Yes, I see. Yeah, bye.

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:01.490
Who did he call?

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:03.530
Yeah, I want to know.

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:14.540
{parte b}

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:22.590
What do you think about this CD?

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:24.680
Hmm... Well...

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:28.310
- It's okay.
- Isn't it?

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:33.890
- Hayama-san?
- Yes.

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:46.160
- Don't push me!
- Kiss!

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:47.990
- Muu...
- Kiss!

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:49.790
I'm home.

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:53.250
Akito, you're home!

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:55.790
My younger brother, Akito, he's eleven.

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:58.130
I heard you are taking karate,
right?

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:00.250
My name is Nishikawa,
nice to meet you.

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:02.510
Hi.

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:06.510
Sorry about that.
My brother is not very social.

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:10.720
That's okay... but your brother...

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:12.560
seems a bit scary.

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:23.400
What attitude was that?!

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:26.610
He went home all because of you!

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:28.570
Sorry.

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:39.340
Sister's boyfriend

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:38.040
I don't know what to say!

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:39.250
I know, I know.

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:44.760
Hayama,
you seem to be in bad mood.

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:45.840
Not really.

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:47.970
You're thinking about something.

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:48.930
Not really!

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:55.060
There's nothing!
Don't get so suspicious!

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:00.690
Really, Nishikawa-kun?

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:02.150
That is...

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:10.950
No, too appropriate. It annoys me
to see someone so fake.

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:13.910
Oh, they're leaving!
Hayama...

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:15.410
Ignore them...

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:17.250
- Let's go home.
- Wait!

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:21.090
I didn't want to say this, but
that guy did the same thing another time...

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:29.680
What's wrong, Hayama?

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:35.850
Mm... not bad, try a little more.

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:37.940
Oh, you're having
stewed pork today.

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:39.310
- Sis.
- Hot!

00:14:39.650 --> 00:14:41.230
What?

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:45.230
That guy won't do.
Forget about him!

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:47.360
That Nishikawa.

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:51.410
What are you saying?
Do you have the right to say that?

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:54.450
You don't know Nishikawa-san at all.

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:57.120
Tell me what you know about him!

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:25.360
Dad...

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:28.440
used to be a bad kid.

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:31.490
What are you talking about, dad?

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:33.120
I've been suspended before!

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:36.830
Dad thought about you having
a boyfriend...

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:40.960
and wanted to stop you from dating.
I was also jealous of your relationship.

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:43.210
Really, I did think that way.

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:46.550
- That... Zaigawa-kun?
- It's Nishikawa-san.

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:48.670
Oh, Okayama-kun, is it?

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:52.590
If Natsumi wants to date him, then
he's probably a nice boy, right?

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:55.300
I've decided to think about it
that way.

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:59.060
Gosh, dad. You sound as if I was
getting married soon!

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:03.690
Something like that...
dad's gonna be lonesome...

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:05.150
You're too ahead of yourself.

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:08.730
We're only high school students,
and besides we've only started dating.

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:12.740
Dad was a bad boy before

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:12.650
So Hayama's father was a bad...

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:18.080
Not again!

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:20.410
See you later.

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:23.330
Nishikawa-kun, about tomorrow...

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:24.880
I gotta go.

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:30.710
Mm, goodbye.

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:38.720
And the next one today is...

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:41.020
Ah! You are...

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:09.920
What the...?!

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:16.890
Ouch! That hurt...

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:23.980
That took a long time, but I still
decided to buy the socks.

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:27.310
You planned on buying that,
remember?

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:29.440
There's a shortcut through the park.

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:30.690
Really?

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:34.650
There's an indecisive somebody
over there!

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:36.740
- Aki!
- Aki-chan!

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:39.490
Goodbye.

00:17:39.990 --> 00:17:41.910
You're like an old man, Hayama!

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:44.910
A woolly look doesn't suit you,
Akito!

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:46.710
It's none of your business.

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:49.750
- You're worried about your sister.
- Right?

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:51.800
I'll tell you. I've seen it too!

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:55.470
You shouldn't be so uncertain, and
say that it is none of our business.

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:57.930
Take action like a man!

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:59.760
Make the business black and white!

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:04.640
Make the business black and white

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:02.310
You'll feel worse, even more uncertain!

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:04.560
I feel sick just hearing what
I'm saying...

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:07.100
That's that.
Fuka, what should we do first?

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:11.570
First check Natsumi's schedule,
then have a showdown at their date.

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:15.070
We'll pull his tail right in front of her, and uncover his true identity!

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:16.900
Uncover his identity!

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:24.450
I get it.

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:26.160
We should hurry to
take a look!

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:26.250
Sis's date

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:28.370
Sis is on a date in Harajuku.

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:30.330
What are we going to do next?

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:32.590
Umm...
let's sit for a little while.

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:34.840
That's why I say he is so fake!

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:36.880
Ah, wait. Don't move.

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:37.970
Excuse me.

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:41.890
Don't be fooled! This guy is only
pretending to be nice and cool.

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:43.760
He even sat next to her!

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:45.720
Why be so incensed?

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:48.100
- Thank you.
- Actually, there was nothing.

00:18:53.020 --> 00:18:56.400
You may think we're a bit bossy,
but please allow us to inspect.

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:57.860
What are you doing?

00:18:57.860 --> 00:18:59.400
First remove the table.

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:00.860
Sana-chan! Fuka-chan...

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:02.320
- What're you doing?
- Akito!

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:05.040
What the...?!

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:08.500
- Please, stop, Sana-chan!
- Wait.

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:10.500
Akito, why are you doing this?

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:14.250
Show your true self!

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:16.590
Tell us everything about the truth!

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:23.550
You're pretty defiant!

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:25.850
We have the proofs,
you better tell me truth!

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:29.390
Hey you two! What do you think you
are doing with my darling? Eh?

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:33.020
So, everyone's here, that's great.

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:37.030
Okay, we've got some evidence.
Just a little bit more!

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:41.860
Pick it up, quick!

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:44.870
Wow! The entire thing is full of
dating schedules with different girls!

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:49.370
Whoa! This one has the girls' birth dates, blood types, and phone numbers!

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:51.790
What is up with this,
Nishikawa-kun?

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:55.000
Didn't you say you had something to do?
So you're on a date with another girl.

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:58.550
How do you explain this?!
Things just got worse...

00:19:58.550 --> 00:19:59.920
Hey you, it's no time to smile
like that.

00:20:00.050 --> 00:20:02.550
What are you talking about?
I'm his girlfriend!

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:04.050
Yeah, right!

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:05.390
Why are you so mad?

00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:08.140
Who said that I can only go out
with one girl at the same time?

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:10.180
Doesn't hurt to have just a few, right?

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:14.560
See? He's that kind of a guy.

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:17.400
Forget about him soon.
What the...?

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:19.780
I'm sure, you are really the
destined girl of my life.

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:28.790
That... that hurt!

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:34.210
Are you alright? Are you okay?

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:38.800
Don't be so interfering!

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:47.010
Ah, Hayama's sister...

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:48.890
I'm sorry...

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:54.600
We overdid it, didn't we?

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:56.100
No.

00:20:56.860 --> 00:20:59.270
We didn't...

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:02.030
Hayama...

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:29.390
When it is seven o'clock,
dad will go home.

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:35.100
Today, Sana and Fuka volunteered
to make dinner.

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:36.980
Daddy was surprised.

00:21:37.480 --> 00:21:42.190
But it seems they are going to take
a while, so I decided to take a little walk.

00:21:44.110 --> 00:21:46.450
Dad is starving...!

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:49.830
Are you not hungry too, Natsumi?

00:21:51.490 --> 00:21:53.750
Mm, I'm hungry too.

00:21:56.960 --> 00:21:59.380
Dad, your stomach is growling.

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:06.550
Akito! You're the last one! Make
sure to lock the door after you leave!

00:22:06.550 --> 00:22:09.050
Your lunch is right here!

00:22:12.430 --> 00:22:15.890
Akito, I'm sorry.

00:22:12.430 --> 00:22:15.890
Thank you!
Sis

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:18.400
- Good morning!
- Good morning!

00:22:19.100 --> 00:22:21.480
I'll make sure that
I remember your birth date!

00:22:21.480 --> 00:22:23.190
That's cool, I'm so happy.

